  - m_Id: 290981939228672
    m_Key: Hints
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306994005127168
    m_Key: Picnic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306994009321472
    m_Key: Cozy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306994009321473
    m_Key: Cloud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941037174784
    m_Key: LEARN TO PLAY  {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923520
    m_Key: Skip tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923521
    m_Key: Match the yarn!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923522
    m_Key: 'Each cat needs yarn of its own color. Tap this cat: the path in front
      of it is clear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923523
    m_Key: The way is clear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923524
    m_Key: Tap this cat now. At the baskets, cats swap yarn automatically. Matching
      all their yarn lets them leave!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923525
    m_Key: Make room first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923526
    m_Key: Only 2 cats fit on the track. Tap this cat first to open the path for
      the cat behind it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923527
    m_Key: Choose the right color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923528
    m_Key: Tap this cat to collect matching yarn. Sending two cats of the same color
      can fill the track and block progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923529
    m_Key: Send the last cat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923530
    m_Key: A track space is free! Tap the last cat. Clear every cat to complete the
      level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923531
    m_Key: Watch the baskets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2127941074923532
    m_Key: Cats leave other colors at the baskets and pick up their own color. Wait
      for a free path and track space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384860758016
    m_Key: Two places on the track
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952320
    m_Key: Only 2 cats fit on the track. Tap this cat to send it to the baskets and
      collect yarn of its own color.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952321
    m_Key: Cats leave yarn of other colors in the baskets and pick up their own color.
      A cat leaves once all its yarn matches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952322
    m_Key: Continue tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2137384864952323
    m_Key: Waiting for track space...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731804307456
    m_Key: Read the track counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501760
    m_Key: 0/2 means no cats on the track, out of 2 allowed. The number on the right
      is the limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501761
    m_Key: These are the baskets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501762
    m_Key: Here, cats leave other colors and collect their own. A cat leaves the
      track once all its yarn matches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501763
    m_Key: Help the other cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501764
    m_Key: Now send this cat to collect its own color. Clear every cat to finish
      the level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501765
    m_Key: Let's try an example
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501766
    m_Key: Send this green cat. We'll try filling both places with green cats to
      see what happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501767
    m_Key: Fill the second place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501768
    m_Key: Send the other green cat too. Both track places will be occupied, leaving
      the blue cat here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501769
    m_Key: Watch the cats...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501770
    m_Key: Now the track is stuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501771
    m_Key: Both places are taken by green cats. They need the green yarn on the blue
      cat, but it cannot enter. Let's restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501772
    m_Key: Restart this level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501773
    m_Key: Tap Restart. Then we'll try an order that frees the track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501774
    m_Key: Try a different order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501775
    m_Key: Start with this green cat. This time, keep the second track place for
      the blue cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501776
    m_Key: Now send the blue cat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731808501777
    m_Key: The blue cat carries green yarn and needs blue yarn. Sending different
      colors lets both cats get what they need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2160169884561408
    m_Key: The track is full
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2160169892950016
    m_Key: '2/2: both places are occupied. Another cat can enter only after a cat
      on the track collects all its yarn and leaves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166080854274048
    m_Key: The green cats need green yarn, but the basket holds blue yarn. Their
      yarn is on the blue cat, which cannot enter the full track. Let's restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166080854274049
    m_Key: Open Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166080854274050
    m_Key: Tap the gear. The Restart button is inside Settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2173509885210624
    m_Key: The green cat needs green yarn to leave the track. Send the blue cat carrying
      that yarn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2178074089074688
    m_Key: Need a hint?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2178074093268992
    m_Key: Tap the light bulb to highlight a cat you can send next. Use it whenever
      you need help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2178074093268993
    m_Key: The light bulb highlights a cat you can send next. Hints are off; you
      can turn them on in Settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
